                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Miner&apos;s Cart" id="194a-66f8-6fd2-8ab0" hidden="false">
                      <description>A Miner&apos;s Cart is a Shrine drawn by a Draft Pony. It may not choose to leave the unit. A unit with a Miner&apos;s Cart can use Blasting Charges every turn rather than just once. However, if the Miner&apos;s Cart is destroyed from a close combat or missile attack, place the centre of the large round template on top of it before removing it. All models under the template suffer a Strength 4 Hit with the Armour Piercing (1) and Flaming Attacks special rules.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
