              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Result" typeId="c322-f782-0f6e-1a5a">Overdrive: The Grudgebreaker counts as having rolled a 10 for its M or A value this turn. However, the Grudgebreaker also suffers D3 Wounds with no saves allowed after it has performed its Movement or Attacks.</characteristic>
