            <characteristic name="Missile" typeId="97ea-ecf7-8d24-b2ca">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="ff58-91e4-84d7-e6e4"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Dive Bomb" id="c862-6489-bf61-dbcf" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per game, during the Remaining Moves sub-phase, models with this special rule may drop bombs unless they are fleeing.

To Dive Bomb, select one unengaged enemy unit that the Gyrocopter moved over in that turn. To determine the damage caused by the bombs, roll an artillery dice; this is the number of hits inflicted as missile attacks from the rear. If a misfire is rolled, the Gyrocopter takes a single Wound with no armour save allowed.

If a Gyrocopter Dive Bombs, it cannot make any other shooting attacks in that turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
