                        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="13f9-a26b-05af-3459">(Special Character, Dwarf)</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Kraggi, Assitant at the Forge" id="fd12-2d82-a692-d950" hidden="false">
                      <description>Kraggi is represented on the tabletop by a separate miniature that always remains as close as possible to Thorek’s Anvil of Doom. The model itself plays no part in the game; if it gets in the way, simply move it to one side. If Thorek is slain, Kraggi is also removed.

Thorek can re-roll a single dice on a failed attempt to Strike the Runes. If this re-rolled dice rolls a 1, Kraggi has done something wrong and Thorek takes a Strength 10 hit. Kraggi is then removed from play and the Kraggi, Assistant at the Forge special rule cannot be used again for the rest of the game.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntry>
