                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="51cc-aa7c-4178-d853">One use only. If the unit carrying a banner with this rune has to take a Break test, the rune is expended. The unit tests as if it were Stubborn. Multiples of this rune have no further elect.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
