                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="51cc-aa7c-4178-d853">A standard bearing three Runes of Battle confers a further +2 bonus to the bearer&apos;s unit&apos;s combat result score, and additionally confers Fight in Extra Ranks (1) to the bearer&apos;s unit.</characteristic>
