                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b5e6-a050-5ffa-0bb5">A war machine engraved with a Rune of Penetration increases the Strength of its shots by +1. Note that in the case of a Grudge Thrower, this bonus increases the Strength of both Strength values in its profile.


A war machine engraved with two Runes of Penetration increases the Strength of its shots by +1, and allows the user to re-roll failed To Wound rolls.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
