                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b5e6-a050-5ffa-0bb5">A war machine engraved with a Master Rune of Slaying always Wound on a 3+ or better against enemy Monstrous Creatures and Monsters.</characteristic>
